 @startuml
hide footbox
title SSD - Create Task(Success)
 actor User
participant "Personal Task Management System" as System

User -> System: createTask(title, description?, priority, dueDate?, project?, tags?)
System -> System:validate(title, priority)
System -> System:createTask()
System -> System:set creationDate
System -> System:set status = open
System -> System:associate project (if provided)
System -> System:associate tags (if provided)
System -> System:recordTaskActivity(taskId, "task created")
System -> User:taskCreated(taskId)




@enduml
